\n<!-- /wp:button --></div>\n<!-- /wp:buttons -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":64} -->\n<div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\" style=\"height:64px\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\";}i:2;O:8:\"stdClass\":7:{s:2:\"id\";i:4715;s:5:\"title\";O:8:\"stdClass\":1:{s:8:\"rendered\";s:26:\"Three column pricing table\";}s:7:\"content\";O:8:\"stdClass\":2:{s:8:\"rendered\";s:3875:\"\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns alignwide is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-2966e5ee wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex\" style=\"margin-bottom:0\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-column has-text-color has-background has-link-color wp-elements-1 is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\" style=\"color:#000000;background-color:#ffe97d;padding-top:2em;padding-right:2em;padding-bottom:2em;padding-left:2em\">\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"single\" style=\"font-size:40px\"><strong>Lajang</strong></h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-normal-font-size wp-block-paragraph\" style=\"line-height:1.5\"><strong>Perkaya komunitas kami yang sedang berkembang.</strong></p>\n\n\n\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-text-color has-css-opacity has-background is-style-wide\" style=\"background-color:#000000;color:#000000\">\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"has-normal-font-size wp-block-list\">\n<li>Tiket masuk umum dan diskon anggota untuk satu orang dewasa</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Satu tiket gratis per pameran khusus</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Dua tiket tamu sekali pakai per tahun</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons alignfull is-horizontal is-content-justification-center is-layout-flex wp-container-core-buttons-is-layout-f68c927c wp-block-buttons-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-button has-custom-width wp-block-button__width-100\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link has-white-color has-text-color has-background no-border-radius wp-element-button\" style=\"background-color:#000000\">$110 / tahun</a></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-column has-text-color has-background has